'''Mr. Douglas''' is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[EP128|The Whistle Stop]]''. He was not given a name in the Japanese version.

He is a farmer working at an apple orchard. He received help from [[Arielle]], who pollinated the apple trees with her {{p|Ledyba}}. Mr. Douglas made a brief appearance when {{Ash}}, {{ashfr}}, and Arielle visited the apple orchard. He drove past them on his tractor to greet Arielle before driving off.

